### Customer-Service : all customers
GET http://localhost:8081/customers

### Customer-Service : one customer
GET http://localhost:8081/customers/1

### Customer-Service : search
GET http://localhost:8081/customers/search?keyword=lin

### Customer-Service : new customer
POST http://localhost:8081/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Omar",
  "lastName": "Bennani",
  "email": "omar@gmail.com"
}

### EBank-Service : all accounts (with customer fetched through OpenFeign)
GET http://localhost:8082/accounts

### EBank-Service : accounts of a customer
GET http://localhost:8082/accounts/customer/1

### EBank-Service : new account
POST http://localhost:8082/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "balance": 5000,
  "currency": "MAD",
  "type": "CURRENT_ACCOUNT",
  "customerId": 2
}

### EBank-Service : debit (replace {{accountId}})
POST http://localhost:8082/accounts/{{accountId}}/debit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 200,
  "description": "Retrait GAB"
}

### EBank-Service : credit
POST http://localhost:8082/accounts/{{accountId}}/credit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1500,
  "description": "Versement"
}

### EBank-Service : operations of an account
GET http://localhost:8082/accounts/{{accountId}}/operations

### Gateway : customers
GET http://localhost:8888/customer-service/customers

### Gateway : accounts
GET http://localhost:8888/ebank-service/accounts

### Circuit breaker state
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/circuitbreakers

### MCP : initialize a session with the MCP server of ebank-service (returns its name and capabilities)
POST http://localhost:8082/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "initialize", "params": {"protocolVersion": "2025-06-18", "capabilities": {}, "clientInfo": {"name": "intellij", "version": "1.0"}}}

### Chatbot : question (the agent calls the MCP tools)
GET http://localhost:8087/chat?query=Quels sont les comptes de Lina ?&conversationId=test

### Chatbot : follow-up question (same conversation, uses the memory)
GET http://localhost:8087/chat?query=Et quelles sont les opérations du compte courant ?&conversationId=test

### Chatbot : through the gateway
GET http://localhost:8888/chatbot-service/chat?query=Liste tous les clients
